// Recommended extensions for this monorepo.
//
// VSCode will prompt adopters to install these on first open via the
// "Recommended" notification.
//
// ⚠️ IMPORTANT — Prisma extension version pin
// -------------------------------------------
// This project pins Prisma ORM to v5.22.x (see apps/api/package.json).
// The latest Prisma VSCode extension has pre-adopted Prisma 7 schema syntax
// (`prisma.config.ts`, no `url` in datasource) and flags valid Prisma 5
// schemas as errors.
//
// → After install, MANUALLY pin the extension to v5.x:
//      Extensions panel → Prisma → ▾ next to Uninstall →
//      "Install Another Version..." → choose 5.22.0 (or latest 5.x).
//
// VSCode does not support project-level version pinning natively, so adopters
// must do this once per machine. When the project upgrades to Prisma 7
// (currently deferred — see docs/code-standards.md), unpin and use latest.
{
  "recommendations": [
    "Prisma.prisma",
    "dbaeumer.vscode-eslint",
    "esbenp.prettier-vscode",
    "dart-code.dart-code",
    "dart-code.flutter"
  ],
  "unwantedRecommendations": []
}
